{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to CHAINED BACKROOMS, a unique co-operative horror action game designed for 1-4 players, where players are chained together and must explore the Backrooms together - a surreal and terrifying place that fans of Lethal Company, REPO, and other atmospheric coop horror titles will appreciate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510750/extras/1_eng.gif?t=1750006834\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510750/extras/2_eng.gif?t=1750006834\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Players are chained together: Players are chained together, which makes interacting with the environment more difficult and requires teamwork. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level Anomaly Search: Fulfil the norm of searching for anomalies and work for the good of science. Or just die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural generation: Each level will be unique with its own features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the schedule: You need to fulfil the daily quota norm so that you can continue your research and finally reduce your sentence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-operative play: Explore the world of Backstage in teams of up to four people. Distance-aware voice chat adds to the realism of interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfectly designed network code: Even with a high ping you won't feel any discomfort!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quarantine Zone : You must finish exploring the Backrooms to get out of the prison. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510750/extras/600x80.png?t=1750006834\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Players will not only have to solve problems and avoid dangerous creatures, but also keep their sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510750/extras/Store.gif?t=1750006834\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510750?t=1750006834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510750?t=1750006834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510750/e2d5e8b7c177b209c9561c4bc8d5aad6e59afccb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750006834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510750/e2d5e8b7c177b209c9561c4bc8d5aad6e59afccb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750006834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3599500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to CHAINED BACKROOMS, a unique co-operative horror action game designed for 1-4 players, where players are chained together and must explore the Backrooms together - a surreal and terrifying place that fans of Lethal Company, REPO, and other atmospheric coop horror titles will appreciate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510750/extras/1_eng.gif?t=1750006834\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img